  "title": "Homemade Pastrami",
  "description": "Make delicious pastrami at home with brisket using Chef John&#39;s recipe for spicy, intensely aromatic pastrami that is easy to make without a smoker.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-23T20:59:29-04:00",
